&lt;p&gt;Generally, it is good to assign an issue to yourself and move it to &lt;em&gt;patch available&lt;/em&gt; status as long as a pull request is ready. This way people actively doing a code review will see the ticket on a review board. A &lt;em&gt;contributor&lt;/em&gt; role in JIRA is needed to assign issues and change statuses. Would you like to be added to a contributors list?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Usual contribution process is described in &lt;a href=&quot;https://ignite.apache.org/community/contribute.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ignite.apache.org/community/contribute.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
